<div class="bs-about"><div class="bs-wrap"><section class="bs-hero"><div><span class="bs-pill">ABOUT BOOKSPOT</span><h1>A better place to discover your next read.</h1><p>BookSpot blends the warmth of a local bookstore with the convenience of a modern online reading marketplace. Browse collections, save favourites, buy books and plan rentals without the clutter.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px"><span class="bs-pill">Curated discovery</span><span class="bs-pill">Easy shopping</span><span class="bs-pill">Reader first</span></div></div><div class="bs-illus"><div class="books-stack"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div></section><div class="bs-grid"><div class="bs-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-compass"></i><h3>Discover</h3><p>Explore categories, collections and recommendations in a calm, bookstore-like experience.</p></div><div class="bs-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i><h3>Save what matters</h3><p>Keep books in your wishlist so good titles do not disappear between visits.</p></div><div class="bs-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-bag-shopping"></i><h3>Checkout simply</h3><p>Update quantities, remove items and move from cart to checkout in a few clean steps.</p></div></div></div></div>